WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.080
What's up guys!

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:01.821
We are Pongfinity.

00:00:01.821 --> 00:00:04.820
Today we are back with another episode of "Challenge Pongfinity".

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:06.980
If you are wondering
what happened to Miikka's hair

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.380
Go check out the 500k special video!

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:11.420
But now to
the challenges!

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:18.560
Okay, so I have shaved my hair off
specifically to find out if I can play with it.

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:34.940
Pretty good head!

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Drop shot!

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:41.820
Good neck exercise!

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:57.300
With my eye!

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:10.280
Nice!

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:14.380
My head serve.

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:29.900
I haven't received any of those serves yet!

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:35.460
Maybe I will start using this serve!

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:38.320
or maybe not...

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:50.720
Was it around the net?

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:51.680
Yes, it was.

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:03.580
You actually won the point.

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:06.400
Alright, now let's try to play off the wall.

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:25.940
I feel like we are playing squash or
something.

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:04.740
Alright, this is an interesting idea.

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:06.580
Let's fill the cups.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.160
Emil why are we even filling the cups?

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:10.480
I have no idea.

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:11.300
Fill mine.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:12.320
Okay.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:15.700
I will actually put some more to you.

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:17.640
No, no, no!

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:21.960
This was a terrible idea.

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:23.780
Okay, let's leave the water out!

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:26.120
No more water!

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:29.880
It looks like we are going to a very strange birthday party.

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:33.380
Your face!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:38.640
It was so close!

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:45.240
Your ball was in the way!

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:56.980
I think that we had some pretty
good challenges today!

00:03:57.480 --> 00:04:01.320
Make sure you keep leaving those comments and
ideas in the comment-section below!

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:04.980
Remember to subscribe here and watch
the previous episodes there!

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:05.860
Until next time

